          > or on <a href="/reference-data/#notify">reference data</a>. If you
          leave your email address, we can reach out to you when it's ready. For
          everything not on the roadmap, feel free to join the <a
            href="https://discord.gg/XBEnx2ZWd5">Discord</a
          > and request it.
        </p>

